{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/15146","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:18.665245+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"NONE","body":"After some trial and error I found the answer!\r\n\r\nTo get it working you need to:\r\n* set [XLA_PYTHON_CLIENT_MEM_FRACTION](https://jax.readthedocs.io/en/latest/gpu_memory_allocation.html) to avoid having processes ask for more memory than available,\r\n* do not _call_ a Jax function before calling `jax.distributed.initialize`[^0],\r\n* pass the `device_id` manually to `jax.distributed.initialize` (`jax.distributed.initialize(local_device_ids=[device_id])`).\r\n\r\nNote that the behavior when using more processes than devices could still be improved.\r\n\r\n[^0]: It took me a long time to realize that I needed to get rid of a call to `jax.device_count`...","created_at":"2023-03-22T23:38:12Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/15146#issuecomment-1480389965","id":1480389965,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/15146","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5YPPVN","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1480389965/reactions"},"updated_at":"2023-03-23T00:57:24Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1480389965","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11976184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nestordemeure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nestordemeure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nestordemeure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nestordemeure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nestordemeure","id":11976184,"login":"nestordemeure","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExOTc2MTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nestordem